# Half Adder
A Verilog implementation of a half adder combinational logic circuit for single-bit binary addition.
 
## Inputs / Outputs
- Inputs: A, B
- Outputs: SUM, CARRY
 
## Files
- `half_adder.v` — RTL design
- `half_adder_tb.v` — Testbench
 
## Simulation
Simulated using Xilinx Vivado. All input combinations (00, 01, 10, 11) are tested and documented in waveforms.
 
